### 注册用户
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "alice",
    "password": "123456"
}

### 登录用户
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "alice",
    "password": "123456"
}

