### 1. 获取验证码
GET http://localhost:8080/api/captcha/get

### 2. 验证码登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "alice",
    "password": "123456",
    "captchaId": "a7c45e9b-ddbb-48e6-b0e4-a2092b32a0f1",
    "captchaAnswer": "61"
}